tps://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620921_1530321752072313_5764229553998068067_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hNUXCkBySKYQ7kNvwHCRPKV&_nc_oc=Adp_tw0UCJGJZG8SwXU7_3K0qyts-6LF0OvwSiKWvdIUk61ftBaAneEPXqhQMllZZSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIv2yx9ycp3GYp3np0yMK_3EqRDcJ431VOF0Z8kUZTBgg&oe=6A9ECE5E"}, {"file_name": "respiratory_4a.png", "id": "783430501425964", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298219_783430504759297_2771609600789730649_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=50V91wgSJ3IQ7kNvwEVcAbR&_nc_oc=Adpzkf5Ttm7Mz6fCV4d_7yYR5HfaS1BaGb5_6iy7dwFvPgoNzmHmQ9v1cyypk4ThehI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVM8dVDgNGUBQuqATAWixr33vc8sjM1wnOVV69l9O0sw&oe=6A9EBECB"}, {"file_name": "respiratory_5a.png", "id": "2163452257767691", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499625099_2163452264434357_4919741016249280913_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nxm36E5YKBIQ7kNvwEZ65d9&_nc_oc=Adp_MtNKRu3SwqptTssrjNiDhplBmBiXE9FX246TN62WjvjKD7VzsjNb-f2lpTfdqxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJowlfgGpyELWOQvCUTCZ4OHiPCdDbdeUXcrOflGSpeMQ&oe=6A9ECA71"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "all_store_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1258349106177786", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1258349109511119_6632702839077757324_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gtr3SOGAV-QQ7kNvwF5Kydu&_nc_oc=AdrDECaGCXld-SeBSuWjZI8NgO6dD5sJe7a_aOiCMni-1MacOfH5bozDLotxk_mqg5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIpRtNguNUd7jgNbulMOhN5YpvWXlKKmkaWnUr-Idy1hQ&oe=6A9EB3B2"}, "display_name": "Anatomy Learning Labs: Respiratory Lab", "keywords": ["anatomy", "biology", "respiratory", "medical", "learning"], "long_description": "Step into the Respiratory Lab of the Anatomy Learning Labs series, where the organs of breathing come to life in stunning 3D. Anatomically accurate models developed by medical professionals and learning activities designed by professors for elementary, middle, and high school learners, teaches students how the respiratory system works together to support life. \n\nThis app leverages the Quest's audio, visual, and hand-tracking capabilities to deliver truly multimodal learning experiences. Students learn by seeing anatomy in three dimensions, hearing explanations, interacting with structures using their own hands, and developing spatial reasoning skills through guided activities.\n\n\u2022\tTravel through medical imaging views that reveal the respiratory system layer by layer, from the nasal cavity and trachea down to the bronchi, lungs, and microscopic alveoli. \n\n\u2022\tSelect any structure to hear Dr. Hana Sato, your virtual guide, identify it by name.\n\n\u2022\tUse natural hand-tracking to grab, rotate, and closely inspect organs and cells. Examine the structure of the lungs, and discover how gas exchange occurs within the alveoli. \n\n\u2022\tStep into Mini Mode to shrink down and observe blood flowing through capillaries from the inside.\n\n\u2022\tAssemble the respiratory system in a 3D puzzle. \n\n\u2022\tTest your knowledge through audio-guided quizzes led by Dr. Sato.\n\n\u2022\t Put your skills to the test in a fast-paced Knowledge Knockout challenge, where you must quickly punch the correct respiratory structures under time pressure.\n", "short_description": "Step into an immersive VR respiratory system laboratory and explore how the human body breathes in stunning 3D. Travel through medical imaging views, examine the lungs, airways, and alveoli using natural hand-tracking, and hear Dr. Hana Sato identify anatomical structures by name. Assemble respiratory anatomy in interactive 3D puzzles, test your knowledge with quizzes, and reinforce learning through engaging challenges designed to make anatomy memorable and fun."}]}, "developer_na